# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
#
# Budget: grok 4.6 high is the default. Composer 2.5 only for planned feature/refactor
# implementation. Never -fast, -max, or -xhigh (cap is high). Never fable, opus 5, grok 4.5.
# No gpt-5.6-sol* on the map. Opus 4.8 only on hardest tasks and one interrogate seat.
# If claude-opus-4-8-thinking-high is unresolvable, skip that subagent or use
# cursor-grok-4.6-high — never substitute claude-opus-5-*.
# Other panels stay 3-wide: grok, composer, sonnet.
